<title>USA: Highlands Ranch Metro #3, Colo., top yld 4.70 pct.</title>
<headline>Highlands Ranch Metro #3, Colo., top yld 4.70 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>AG Edwards &amp; Sons Inc said Tuesday it tentatively priced $8.6 million of Highlands Ranch Metropolitan District #3, Douglas County, Colo., general obligation bank qualified bonds, with a top yield of 4.70 percent in 2001.</p>
</text>
